        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Anthology 1\n- People: Stuart Sutcliffe, Pete Best\n- Organizations: the Beatles\n- Topics: archival recordings, live performances\n\nFacts:\n- Stuart Fergusson Victor Sutcliffe was born on 23 June 1940.\n- Stuart Sutcliffe was a British painter and musician best known as the original bass guitarist for the Beatles.\n- Stuart Sutcliffe died on 10 April 1962.\n- Anthology 1 features rarities, outtakes, and live performances from the Beatles’ 1958–1964 period.\n- Anthology 1 includes songs featuring original bass player Stuart Sutcliffe and drummer Pete Best.",
